Package: motanka-qt6
Architecture: amd64
Depends: motanka-stack-libs,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: Qt 6 for the Motanka Stack on Ubuntu 24.04
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. Its desktop
 shell, Quickshell, needs Qt 6.6 or later; Ubuntu 24.04 has Qt 6.4.
 .
 This package holds Qt 6.10 (Base, Declarative, Wayland, SVG and Shader
 Tools): the libraries in /opt/motanka/lib and the plugins and QML modules
 in /opt/motanka/lib/qt6. Only programs of the Motanka Stack, which find
 these libraries through RUNPATH, use it; Ubuntu's own Qt is unchanged.
 It depends on motanka-stack-libs for GCC 16's C++ runtime.

