XB-Motanka-Build-Only: yes
Description: Qt 6 for the Motanka Stack on Ubuntu 24.04 - build files
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. Its desktop
 shell, Quickshell, needs Qt 6.6 or later; Ubuntu 24.04 has Qt 6.4.
 .
 This package holds the headers, CMake files, tools and mkspecs of the Qt
 6.10 in motanka-qt6, under /opt/motanka. The motanka-stack-shell build
 uses it. It is a build-time package only and is never published in a
 Motanka repository suite.
